    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's actually a really good point about the rehearsed responses. i noticed one guy yesterday who i've seen near the corner store at least three times this week, and every time he's just... standing there, looking at his phone but not really using it. it's like he's waiting for a signal or something. if i wanted to actually confirm this, like see if they're recording my movements or something, how would i do that without making it obvious that i'm onto them? i don't want to tip them off if they are actually part of some study.",
